        "text": "=🚨 *n8n Workflow Failed*\n\n{{ $json.Severity === 'Critical' ? '🔴' : $json.Severity === 'Warning' ? '🟠' : '🔵' }} *{{ $json.Severity }}*\n*Workflow:* {{ $('Extract Error Details').item.json.Workflow_name }}\n*Failed Node:* {{ $('Extract Error Details').item.json.Failed_node }} \n*Error:* {{ $('Extract Error Details').item.json.Error_message }} \n*Execution ID:* {{ $('Extract Error Details').item.json.Execution_id }} \n*Time:* {{ $('Extract Error Details').item.json.Timestamp }} \n*Link:* {{ $('Extract Error Details').item.json.Execution_url }}\n",
